我的大麻
My weed.

174
00:07:10,720 --> 00:07:12,660
这下好了 都开始上课了
Oh, great, look. Class has started.

175
00:07:12,760 --> 00:07:14,140
我的新生活已经搞砸了
My new life already blows.

176
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:16,960
帅气大厨在里面呢
Oh, look. There's Chef gorgeous.

177
00:07:17,220 --> 00:07:18,680
我不想让他看到我这么狼狈
I don't want him to see me like this.

178
00:07:18,860 --> 00:07:19,960
我去洗手间看看
I'm gonna go to the restroom and see

179
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,580
能不能用冷水把这脏污弄掉
if cold water can get out any of the stain.

180
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:24,800
-快进去上课 -可是我的厨师服跟书包没了
- Go, Max. - But I don't have my chef coat or book bag.

181
00:07:25,060 --> 00:07:26,700
我知道它们只在我生命中存在过几小时
I know I only had them for a couple of hours,

182
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:28,071
但那是我最美好的时光
but it was the best part of me.

183
00:07:28,071 --> 00:07:29,700
你能行的
You'll do great.

184
00:07:29,700 --> 00:07:31,380
先帮我个忙 检查我有没有虱子
First, do me a favor. Check me for lice.

185
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:36,440
这门课是设计来向你们介绍
This course is designed to introduce you

186
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:38,420
一些技术与技巧
to the skills and techniques required

187
00:07:40,139 --> 00:07:43,400
酥皮面团 奶黄饼 泡芙
short pastry doughs, custards, pate a choux,

188
00:07:43,400 --> 00:07:44,279
以及蛋糕糊等等
and cake batters.

189
00:07:44,279 --> 00:07:46,143
麦克斯大厨 你迟到了
Chef Max, you are late.

190
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:48,240
你确定课不是10点17分开始吗
Wait, are sure class doesn't start at 10:17?

191
00:07:49,820 --> 00:07:52,100
对不起 我在地铁上被混蛋给抢劫了
Sorry, I got robbed on the subway by some jerk.

192
00:07:52,580 --> 00:07:54,340
喂喂喂 干嘛指鼻子骂我
Hey, hey, hey, I'm right here.

193
00:07:56,540 --> 00:07:58,220
我没钱走投无路
I ran out of options, and I didn't wanna

194
00:07:58,560 --> 00:07:59,820
又不想跳脱衣舞赚学费 所以...
strip my way through pastry school.

195
00:08:01,420 --> 00:08:02,400
可以靠脱衣舞赚学费吗
That's an option?

196
00:08:03,332 --> 00:08:05,479
好了 厨师们 专心点
All right, Chefs. Let's focus.

197
00:08:06,140 --> 00:08:07,160
他刚是说他想"搞我们"[专心]吗
Did he say he wants to "foke us"?

198
00:08:18,320 --> 00:08:19,180
早安啊 碧碧
Morning, Bebe.

199
00:08:19,860 --> 00:08:22,040
天啊 你这是怎么了
Hi. Oh, my God. What happened to you?

200
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:24,040
我先提醒你 我的医生说
And I should tell you my doctor says

201
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:26,120
我接下来一个月内都不应该听到坏消息
I'm not allowed to hear bad news for another month.

202
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:29,000
抱歉我这么狼狈来上班
I apologize for my appearance.

203
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,440
但我们在地铁上被抢了
We got robbed on the subway,

204
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,040
然后被拿着热咖啡的人弄了一身
and then someone hit me with hot coffee.

205
00:08:32,340 --> 00:08:34,000
然后我去用了冷水想洗掉咖啡渍
Then, I went to wash cold water on the stain

206
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,460
结果没洗掉 还弄得像要参加
and somehow wound up entering myself

207
00:08:35,460 --> 00:08:36,680
性感"湿身"选美赛了
in a wet t-shirt contest.

208
00:08:38,780 --> 00:08:41,400
负面能量太多我扛不住
Um, that's a lot of energy for me,

209
00:08:42,640 --> 00:08:44,340
先让我坐在位子上休息
So I'm just gonna need to sit here

210
00:08:44,340 --> 00:08:45,660
然后平静一会吧
for a second and be quiet.

211
00:08:47,980 --> 00:08:49,860
我知道我现在该让你平静 我也支持
I know we're being quiet, which I'm all about,

212
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:50,980
好可爱的小狗啊
but cute dogs.

213
00:08:51,380 --> 00:08:53,160
谢谢 这是可卡犬
Oh, thanks. They're cocker spaniels.

214
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:54,160
我拯救了他们
I rescue them.

215
00:08:54,180 --> 00:08:56,280
大家都想着去拯救灰狗 斗牛犬啊
You know, people rescue greyhounds and pit bulls,

216
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:58,100
但都没人想到可卡也需要拯救
but everyone ignores the cocker spaniel.

217
00:08:58,100 --> 00:09:00,780
都觉得可卡犬恶心 要宰了他们
They're like, "Ew, eye goo. Shoot it."

218
00:09:02,620 --> 00:09:04,240
我养了三只可卡[三根鸡鸡]
I have three cockers.

219
00:09:04,620 --> 00:09:05,540
你有宠物吗
Do you have any pets?

220
00:09:06,260 --> 00:09:07,900
有匹马 叫栗宝
I have a horse, Chestnut.

221
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:08,880
他是只纯种马
He's a thoroughbred.

222
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:17,120
我该从哪里开始帮忙呢
Well, what can I do first?

223
00:09:19,580 --> 00:09:22,040
这是什么 为什么给了我果汁菜单
What's this? Why am I holding a juice menu?

224
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,260
每天我们都为所有学生与员工
Every day, we get fresh-pressed juice

225
00:09:24,260 --> 00:09:25,560
买新鲜的鲜榨果汁
for the students and the staff.

226
00:09:25,560 --> 00:09:26,860
太享受了
What a treat.

227
00:09:27,100 --> 00:09:28,280
新鲜果汁是纯骗钱的
Fresh juice is such a scam

228
00:09:28,280 --> 00:09:29,220
但是别人请的就不算
unless someone else is payin'.

229
00:09:30,020 --> 00:09:31,800
我要一杯绿色三号
I'll take the greens number three.

230
00:09:32,140 --> 00:09:33,300
好的 写上单子
Uh-huh, well, put it on the list

231
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:34,200
然后去问别人要喝什么吧
when you get the other ones.

232
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,480
等等 所以是我得去买果汁吗
Wait, I'm supposed to get the juice?

233
00:09:37,060 --> 00:09:39,300
我就是坏消息集中地
Oh, boy, it's like I'm a bad news machine.

234
00:09:42,540 --> 00:09:43,020
没关系
Okay.

235
00:09:43,600 --> 00:09:45,920
乐意效劳 没意料到 但很乐意帮忙
Happy to do it. Surprised, but happy.

236
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:50,500
那我可以借一套那可爱的厨师服穿穿吗
Uh, maybe I could change into one of those cute Chef jackets.

237
00:09:51,240 --> 00:09:54,480
尼可拉斯大厨规定了只有烘焙厨师能穿
Oh, Chef Nicholas only permits pastry Chefs to wear these.

238
00:09:54,920 --> 00:09:57,760
但我不能第一天就这么狼狈的出场吧
But I can't meet everyone on my first day looking like this.

239
00:09:57,840 --> 00:09:59,700
当买果汁的人已经够惨了吧
I mean, it's already bad enough I'm the juice girl.

240
00:10:00,860 --> 00:10:02,640
我有一些健身衣服可以给你穿
I have some workout clothes you can wear.

241
00:10:02,820 --> 00:10:04,540
你放心 我一次都还没穿过
Don't worry. I haven't worn them yet.

242
00:10:04,740 --> 00:10:05,900
但总有一天会穿的
But I will someday.

243
00:10:12,540 --> 00:10:13,980
你们好 大家好啊
Hi. Hi, everyone.

244
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:15,460
我是来问你们喝什么鲜果汁
I'm here to take the fresh juice orders

245
00:10:15,460 --> 00:10:17,720
也顺便说一声 我本来上班穿的不是这个
and also to say this is not what I came to work in.

246
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:20,960
我穿的衣服可没瞪着大眼的狗头
What I came to work in had less eyes.

247
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:22,920
卡洛琳 欢迎你
Caroline, welcome.

248
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:26,000
-在办公室干得怎么样 -很好
- How is it going in the office so far? - So great,

249
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:28,160
我今天真不是穿这个来上班
and so not what I came to work in.

250
00:10:28,740 --> 00:10:31,000
通常我穿的都是香奈儿 而不是犬衣
I'm usually wearing Chanel, not le chien.

251
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:32,840
那是法语"狗"的意思
That's "dog" in French.

252
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,160
那也是英语"二"的意思
Oh, 'cause it's "dork" in English.

253
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:39,400
很高兴见到你们俩
Well, it is lovely to see both of your faces.

254
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:43,200
同学 我们先从基本的开始
Class, we start with the basics.

255
00:10:43,520 --> 00:10:44,520
不 不 后面的同学
No, no, no, you in the back--

256
00:10:44,680 --> 00:10:46,240
喝果汁吗 小姐 想从一个
Juice, miss? Care for a juice

257
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:48,660
高考成绩1560分的人那点果汁吗[旧制满分1600]
from someone who scored 1560 on her SATs?

258
00:10:49,200 --> 00:10:50,600
你居然考超过500分
You can score more than 500?

259
00:10:53,160 --> 00:10:54,760
你干嘛要穿这件衣服啊
Why the hell are you wearing that?

260
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,760
这让你的胸部显得更平更悲哀
I didn't think your chest could get any sadder.

261
00:10:57,445 --> 00:10:59,520
这是碧碧的衣服
It's Bebe's.

262
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:02,200
麦克斯 我来这工作不是帮人点果汁的
Max, taking juice orders is not what I came here to do.

263
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,780
我懂你意思 我点一杯宝石红
I hear you. I'll have the ruby red.

264
00:11:05,240 --> 00:11:06,740
我总是保持花嘴干净[龟头]
I always keep the edge clean,

265
00:11:06,740 --> 00:11:07,860
这样当我挤[射]的时候
So when I'm squeezing it,

266
00:11:07,860 --> 00:11:10,300
奶油[精液]就不会喷得哪儿都是了
It's not gonna have cream popping all over the place.

267
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:13,720
警世良言啊
Words to live by.

268
00:11:14,980 --> 00:11:16,440
可惜我恰恰相反
I have the opposite problem.

269
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,980
瞧 我的"奶油"喷涌而出
Yo, my cream's poppin' right now.

270
00:11:22,100 --> 00:11:23,100
你这是干嘛
What are you doing?

271
00:11:23,220 --> 00:11:25,040
你答应过我会认真上课的
You told me you were gonna take school seriously.

272
00:11:25,140 --> 00:11:27,160
不能怪我 是那家伙带坏我
It's not me. That guy's a bad influence.

273
00:11:27,260 --> 00:11:27,940
你看他
Look at him.

274
00:11:28,160 --> 00:11:30,640
他长得就像芝麻街卡通里买毒品的人
He looks like someone who sells drugs on Sesame Street.

275
00:11:33,580 --> 00:11:34,820
你敢玩出火就杀了你
You're gonna get in trouble,

276
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:36,400
我牺牲穿可卡犬衣服
and I am not wearing a cocker spaniel

277
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,740
可不是为了看你被踢出去
so you can get kicked out of class.

278
00:11:37,820 --> 00:11:38,900
好 我知道了
Right. I hear you.

279
00:11:38,920 --> 00:11:39,640
话说我的果汁呢
Now, where's my juice?

280
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,500
麦克斯大厨 快看我的独家技能
Hey, Chef Max. Check out my technique.

281
00:11:47,020 --> 00:11:48,920
超棒超恶心的声音
Awesome gross sound bonus.

282
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:53,020
大厨 你要觉得这样玩很有意思
Chef, if you find this so funny,

283
00:11:53,229 --> 00:11:55,620
不如你出去跟"五指"姑娘玩吧
why don't you take a fiver?

284
00:11:55,620 --> 00:11:57,000
反正你不就爱说这些吗
Isn't this how your saying goes?

285
00:11:57,300 --> 00:11:58,620
我没爱说这些
I don't have a saying,

286
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:00,261
但如果我有 那应该是
but if I did, it'd be more like

287
00:12:00,261 --> 00:12:02,280
"口交不算偷吃"
"Eatin' ain't cheatin'."

288
00:12:06,820 --> 00:12:08,900
如果有人觉得有东西很好笑
Anyone else who finds something hilarious

289
00:12:08,900 --> 00:12:11,160
可以跟他一起去走廊
can also go into the hall.

290
00:12:11,680 --> 00:12:13,180
-麦克斯大厨 -不用了 一点都不好笑
- Chef Max? - Nope, nothing 'ilarious.

291
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:14,360
继续上课吧
Teach on.

292
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:16,500
不许再开黄腔了
Enough with the dirty jokes.

293
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:19,100
我们来这的目的是成为优秀的面包师[自慰师]
We are all here to become master bakers.

294
00:12:22,060 --> 00:12:24,500
我在掌握烘焙[自慰]这方面可是下了不少[硬]功夫
Master-baking is something I work really hard at it.

295
00:12:25,580 --> 00:12:27,300
-要成为一名优秀的烘焙师 -我自己去走廊吧
- To be a master baker-- - I'll be in the hall.

296
00:12:34,740 --> 00:12:37,020
-我是迪克 -你刚是说自己是"怪胎"吗
- Hi, I'm Deke. - Did you say "Freak?"

297
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,660
-是迪克 -是"怪咖"吗
- Deke. - Did you say "Geek?"

298
00:12:40,060 --> 00:12:42,080
大"鸟"迪克的迪克
Deke, as in "Big Deke."

299
00:12:45,820 --> 00:12:46,660
我的更大
Mine's bigger.

300
00:12:50,160 --> 00:12:51,580
我们应该成为搭档
We should be lab partners.

301
00:12:52,060 --> 00:12:53,120
来嘛 这组合超棒的
Come on. It'll be bitchin'.

302
00:12:53,940 --> 00:12:55,460
超大号[麦克斯]大鸟 一起做蛋糕
Max and Deke, making cakes.

303
00:12:56,180 --> 00:12:57,540
周日 周日 周日
Sunday, Sunday, Sunday,

304
00:12:57,540 --> 00:12:59,240
主义乐团要为我们带来特别演出
with a special performance by Creed.

305
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:02,240
好了 别玩了 别玩了
Okay, now stop, stop, stop.

306
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,820
我在努力当个好学生
I am trying to be a good student,

307
00:13:03,820 --> 00:13:05,302
所以你离我远点
so you just stay away from me.

308
00:13:05,302 --> 00:13:06,940
你会带坏我的
You are a bad influence.

309
00:13:06,940 --> 00:13:08,720
我这番话肯定超顺 因为小时候
And I know I nailed that speech 'cause kids at school

310
00:13:08,720 --> 00:13:09,720
同学们总对我说这番话
used to say it to me all the time.

311
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,740
-到时间换卫生棉了吗 -是的
- Time to change your tampon? - Yep.

312
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,440
经期第二天 流量超大
Day two. Serious flow.

313
00:13:18,060 --> 00:13:20,480
腰包真可爱 你的最炫民族风披肩在哪里
Killer fanny pack. Where's your tribal poncho?

314
00:13:22,460 --> 00:13:23,260
那是用来放针的
Ah, keep my needles in this.

315
00:13:23,860 --> 00:13:25,180
你居然还是个瘾君子
You're a drug addict too?

316
00:13:25,460 --> 00:13:27,460
天啊 想不跟你一起混真难
God. You are irresistible.

317
00:13:28,940 --> 00:13:30,920
是用来打胰岛素的 我是个糖尿病患
It's--it's insulin. I'm a diabetic.

318
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:33,260
一个患有糖尿病的甜点大厨
A diabetic pastry Chef.

319
00:13:33,620 --> 00:13:35,700
你的自毁倾向比我的强多了
Wow, you're even more self-destructive than me.

320
00:13:37,300 --> 00:13:38,860
糖尿病 什么感觉啊
So diabetes, how is that?

321
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:41,160
很没劲 我宁可得梅毒
Disappointing. I put in for syphilis.

322
00:13:43,620 --> 00:13:46,240
别笑了 老娘要穿着这衣服
Stop laughing. I have to carry 27 juices

323
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:47,800
去两个街区外扛27杯果汁
2 blocks wearing this.

324
00:13:49,240 --> 00:13:51,240
你干嘛让狗头女这样跟你说话啊
Why'd you let the dog lady talk to you like that?

325
00:13:52,620 --> 00:13:54,580
即使穿着那件傻逼衣服 她还是我的朋友
She's my friend, even in that shirt.

326
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,880
又花了我12块钱
Well, there goes another $12.

327
00:14:03,540 --> 00:14:05,680
我干洗这件衬衫的钱
I have spent more money dry cleaning this blouse

328
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,780
比我健康保险上花的钱还多
than I have on health care.

329
00:14:08,060 --> 00:14:10,000
健保 你是说我们从9毛9店
Health care? You mean that box of band-aids

330
00:14:10,000 --> 00:14:11,140
买回来的那一盒子止血贴吧
We got at the 99 cent store?

331
00:14:12,440 --> 00:14:14,360
我明天一定要漂漂亮亮地去上班
I just have to look good tomorrow.

332
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:15,680
今天太丢脸了
Today was mortifying.

333
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:18,560
我被果汁店员叫"倒霉狗"
They called me "sad dog" at the juice place.

334
00:14:20,580 --> 00:14:22,780
"倒霉狗 你的果汁好了"
"Sad dog, your juices are ready."

335
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:25,880
倒霉狗 上菜了
Sad dog, pick up.

336
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:30,680
你能拿去十号桌吗 我在照看卡座区
Can you take these to table ten? I'm backed up on the booths.

337
00:14:30,720 --> 00:14:32,800
你去吧 我要坐在这休息一会
Can you? I'm kind of just sitting here a minute,

338
00:14:34,500 --> 00:14:36,000
享受不被人使唤的美好时光
enjoying not being told what to do.

339
00:14:36,060 --> 00:14:37,340
我在那间学校真是受够了
I get enough of it at that school.

340
00:14:38,800 --> 00:14:39,200
听着
Look.

